        "date": "2025-11-24T09:37:57Z"
      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Reorganize several registers layout for spec v0.8.1\n\nThe following descriptions summarize register layout changes:\n- Change ENTRYOFFSET from offset 0x14 to 0x2C.\n- Add new HWCFG3 register which indicates the extended configurations of\n  current IOPMP instance for application note.\n- Rename prient_prog to prio_ent_prog.\n- Move sps_en, chk_x, prient_prog, stall_en, peis, pees and mfr_en from\n  HWCFG0 to HWCFG2.\n- Remove HWCFG0.user_cfg_en\n- Move mdcfg_fmt, srcmd_fmt, md_entry_num, no_x, no_w, rrid_transl_en,\n  and rrid_transl_prog from HWCFG0 to HWCFG3.\n- Move rrid_transl from HWCFG2 to HWCFG3.",
      "tree": {
