      "message": "Reference Model: Add new HWCFG2.non_prio_en for non-priority entry feature\n\nThe specification v0.8.1 adds new HWCFG2.non_prio_en bit to indicate\nwhether the IOPMP supports non-priority entries. We add new\nIOPMP_NON_PRIO_EN into config.h to let user configure non-priority\nentries support. If HWCFG2.non_prio_en=0, the HWCFG2.prio_entry and\nHWCFG2.prio_ent_prog are hardwired to 0.",
